background jobs

  auth.SendLink  queue default, 5 attempts, timeout 30s, args: email, kind
  issues.Notify  queue notifications, 5 attempts, timeout 10s, args: actor_id, issue_id, kind, user_id
  queue default  10 workers
  queue notifications  5 workers
  every node runs jobs and cron (Config.Jobs run)

broadcasts reach every node's pages, by Postgres NOTIFY (in-process without a database)
responses carry Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
